{"title":"Mobile scanner settings","description":"Turn phone uploads by QR code on or off and choose how uploaded photos are converted to PDF on a self-hosted server.","unlisted":false,"space":"server","layout":"","article":"<a class=\"doc-space\" data-accent=\"server\" href=\"/Server/\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 6.5h.01M7 17.5h.01\"/></svg><span>Self-hosted server</span></a>\n    <h1>Mobile scanner settings</h1>\n<p>Control the <a href=\"/Tools/Guides/Mobile-Scanner/\">mobile scanner</a>, which lets people scan a QR code and upload photos from their phone. It is on by default.</p>\n<h2 id=\"before-you-start\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Before you start<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#before-you-start\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><p>The QR code sends phones to your server's <strong>Frontend URL</strong> (<code>system.frontendUrl</code>), set under <strong>Settings → Server → System → Branding &amp; appearance</strong>. Set it to an address phones can reach, such as <code>https://pdf.example.com</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"settings\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Settings<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#settings\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><p>Open <strong>Settings → Server → Integrations → Mobile Phone Upload</strong>, or edit <code>settings.yml</code>:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Field in Settings</th>\n<th>Setting</th>\n<th>Default</th>\n<th>Purpose</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Enable QR Code Upload</strong></td>\n<td><code>system.enableMobileScanner</code></td>\n<td><code>true</code></td>\n<td>Turn phone uploads on or off.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Convert Images to PDF</strong></td>\n<td><code>system.mobileScannerSettings.convertToPdf</code></td>\n<td><code>true</code></td>\n<td>Turn uploaded photos into a PDF. Off keeps the images as they are.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Image Resolution</strong></td>\n<td><code>system.mobileScannerSettings.imageResolution</code></td>\n<td><code>full</code></td>\n<td><code>full</code> keeps the original size; <code>reduced</code> scales to at most 1200 px on the longest side.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Page Format</strong></td>\n<td><code>system.mobileScannerSettings.pageFormat</code></td>\n<td><code>A4</code></td>\n<td><code>keep</code> (original image size), <code>A4</code> or <code>letter</code>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Stretch to Fit</strong></td>\n<td><code>system.mobileScannerSettings.stretchToFit</code></td>\n<td><code>false</code></td>\n<td>Stretch images to fill the page. Off centres them and keeps their proportions.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The last three only apply when <strong>Convert Images to PDF</strong> is on.</p>\n<div class=\"tabs\" data-group=\"config-methods\" data-sync=\"true\" id=\"tabs-0\"><div class=\"tab-list\" role=\"tablist\"><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn active\" data-value=\"settings\" aria-selected=\"true\">Settings File</button><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-value=\"env\" aria-selected=\"false\">Environment Variable</button><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-value=\"docker-compose\" aria-selected=\"false\">Docker Compose</button></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel active\" data-value=\"settings\">\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">yaml</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">system</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  enableMobileScanner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  mobileScannerSettings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    convertToPdf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    imageResolution</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">full</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    pageFormat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">A4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    stretchToFit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</div>\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-value=\"env\">\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SYSTEM_ENABLEMOBILESCANNER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SYSTEM_MOBILESCANNERSETTINGS_CONVERTTOPDF</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SYSTEM_MOBILESCANNERSETTINGS_IMAGERESOLUTION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">full</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SYSTEM_MOBILESCANNERSETTINGS_PAGEFORMAT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">A4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SYSTEM_MOBILESCANNERSETTINGS_STRETCHTOFIT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">false</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</div>\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-value=\"docker-compose\">\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">yaml</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  stirling-pdf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      SYSTEM_ENABLEMOBILESCANNER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      SYSTEM_MOBILESCANNERSETTINGS_CONVERTTOPDF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      SYSTEM_MOBILESCANNERSETTINGS_IMAGERESOLUTION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">full</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      SYSTEM_MOBILESCANNERSETTINGS_PAGEFORMAT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">A4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      SYSTEM_MOBILESCANNERSETTINGS_STRETCHTOFIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"false\"</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</div></div>\n<h2 id=\"related-settings\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Related settings<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#related-settings\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><ul>\n<li><code>system.enableMobileSignature</code> (default <code>true</code>) lets people draw a signature on their phone from the Sign tool, using the same QR code flow. It also needs the frontend URL.</li>\n<li><strong>Hide Mobile Scanner</strong> (<code>ui.hideDisabledTools.mobileQRScanner</code>, default <code>false</code>) hides the upload button when the scanner is off.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Uploaded files are held in temporary storage on the server and removed once downloaded or after 10 minutes of inactivity.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"doc-source\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-Tools.github.io/edit/main/docs/Server/Customisation/Mobile-Scanner.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M17 3a2.83 2.83 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5L17 3z\"/></svg>\n        Edit this page on GitHub\n      </a>\n    </div>","toc":"<div class=\"toc-title\">On this page</div><ul><li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#before-you-start\">Before you start</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#settings\">Settings</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#related-settings\">Related settings</a></li></ul>","pager":"<a class=\"pager-link pager-prev\" href=\"/Server/Customisation/Extra-Settings/\">\n        <span class=\"pager-dir\">&larr; Previous</span>\n        <span class=\"pager-title\">Extra settings</span>\n      </a><a class=\"pager-link pager-next\" href=\"/Server/Customisation/PDF-to-CBR/\">\n        <span class=\"pager-dir\">Next &rarr;</span>\n        <span class=\"pager-title\">PDF to CBR</span>\n      </a>"}